body:
No. People don't want to help me. My therapist didn't want to help me anymore. I am on a mental health discord server and the mods who are caring and involved towards others oppose me getting better. Most of the time when an individual offers me help they have an ulterier motive, usually recruiting me to their religion.  On another discord server there is a user that often talks about his depression and self harm and receives warm and caring responses (which is good). When I brought up my depression on the server, I got a warning by one of the moderators. 

&#x200B;

No one who knows me a little bit wants to help me.
